    {
      "id": "jNvOxDU-axXN3eBY_nH-q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 312.0009591756045,
      "y": 767.1192181640207,
      "width": 861.7109275589883,
      "height": 130.87020874023438,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 187060165,
      "version": 738,
      "versionNonce": 849245355,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769852192632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When JS doesnot find property or method in that element's (e.g. Array, String ...) \nprototype then it go into it's parents prototype again and again, until it reached\nthe Objects prototype.\nBeacuse Object does not have any parent, means it point to null  \n ",
      "fontSize": 20.9392333984375,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When JS doesnot find property or method in that element's (e.g. Array, String ...) \nprototype then it go into it's parents prototype again and again, until it reached the Objects prototype.\nBeacuse Object does not have any parent, means it point to null  \n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p-acm8UyOhvlloXTneM5g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 477.4470509378999,
